  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/tarball/v1.14.20",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/zipball/v1.14.20",
  "body": "# SnowLuma v1.14.20\n\n> **跨平台正式支持：** Windows x64、Linux x64 与 Linux arm64 均可完整运行 SnowLuma，包含 QQ 接入、OneBot v11 与 WebUI 管理能力。\n\n## 选择下载\n\n| 平台 | 完整版（内置 Node.js，推荐） | Lite（Node.js 22.13+；23 系需 23.4+） |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Windows x64 | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-win-x64.zip` | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-win-x64-lite.zip` |\n| Linux x64 | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-linux-x64.tar.gz` | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-linux-x64-lite.tar.gz` |\n| Linux arm64 | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-linux-arm64.tar.gz` | `SnowLuma-v1.14.20-linux-arm64-lite.tar.gz` |\n\n完整版适合直接解压运行；Lite 版不包含 Node.js，但其余运行时依赖和 WebUI 静态资源保持一致。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n1. 解压与你的系统架构匹配的压缩包。\n2. Windows 运行 `launcher.bat`；Linux 运行 `./launcher.sh`。\n3. 浏览器访问 http://localhost:5099，初始账号为 `admin`，密码见启动日志。\n\n无人值守部署可同时设置 `SNOWLUMA_ACCEPT_EULA=1` 与 `SNOWLUMA_ACCEPT_PRIVACY=1` 完成协议确认。设置这些变量即表示运营者已阅读并同意发行包内的 EULA 与隐私政策；缺少任意一项时仍会显示同意页面。\n\n## 本次更新\n\n- fix(protocol): support image replies in existing temp sessions ([1914880d](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/1914880df48f1b3f5bb4f852d669bf9dbe00bbc3))\n- feat(sdk): preserve system face animation choices ([ad360c8e](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/ad360c8eba5a555e40c64f3e3ecb4ee58d60f992))\n- feat(onebot): send saved custom faces with sticker presentation ([0cc06b6b](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/0cc06b6b5eb959cada484414dc2817f2f8ebb7fa))\n- fix(protocol): preserve all system face catalog groups ([e05d3176](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/e05d3176a2a25fead7978813f9ba2fdd058b9c49))\n- fix(protocol): classify private file subcommand receipts ([075a27cc](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/075a27cc46ce18fcfc34bc08f73ea177166f78df))\n- feat(onebot): support choosing animated system faces ([805665a6](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/805665a6d6b8e7a54acf100755faae8287a4f372))\n- fix(protocol): avoid duplicate text for animated faces ([953b18b5](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/953b18b5cbc56346337923bcf81f2268c3f76056))\n- feat(onebot): include text alongside received markdown ([1934e4e7](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/1934e4e7f7e630f895df174d19b4ec65b6935a2d))\n- fix(webui): hide sidebar pin controls in menu mode ([726fbc6c](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/726fbc6c67f6d1188c20fed9e95e90aa5c6ea443))\n- ci: migrate npm publishing to trusted OIDC ([0591b160](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/commit/0591b160fb913131bece693eefd1d0a2ee5a1bbb))\n\n[查看 v1.14.19 → v1.14.20 的完整差异](https://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/compare/v1.14.19...v1.14.20)\n",
